# Canonical high-resolution portrait masters (issue #70): never required by the
# application build — the committed optimized derivatives under public/ are the
# only portrait assets the app consumes. Keeping this directory out of the
# Docker build context keeps builder payloads small. Rejected/unreferenced
# master copies must never be re-added here.
